{"id":"07845482f0a2f378","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md","title":"标准真理下可靠性等价于全局真理反思","display":"thm-soundness-equivalence — 标准真理下可靠性等价于全局真理反思","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-soundness-equivalence","aliases":["91-thm-soundness-equivalence"],"display":"thm-soundness-equivalence — 标准真理下可靠性等价于全局真理反思","depends_on":["[[91-df-soundness-predicate]]","[[91-df-global-reflection]]","[[91-df-truth-predicate]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-soundness-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-soundness-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-soundness-equivalence — 标准真理下可靠性等价于全局真理反思"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"acda8ebf92673c3d\" href=\"?note=acda8ebf92673c3d\" title=\"91-df-soundness-predicate\">91-df-soundness-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"16b107dfee99998b\" href=\"?note=16b107dfee99998b\" title=\"91-df-global-reflection\">91-df-global-reflection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> (可递归公理化的算术理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> (标准自然数模型)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x),\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathcal S}(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x),\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathcal S}(x)\\)</span> (句子编码与可证性谓词)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\n\\ \\mathbb N\\models\\varphi\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\n\\ \\mathbb N\\models\\varphi\\}\\)</span> (标准真算术句的编码集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N_{\\operatorname{True}}\n\\coloneqq(\\mathbb N,\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N})\">\\(\\mathbb N_{\\operatorname{True}}\n\\coloneqq(\\mathbb N,\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N})\\)</span>\n(把新谓词恰解释为该编码集的标准扩张)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathcal S)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\mathcal S\\vdash\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi)\">\\(\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathcal S)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\mathcal S\\vdash\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathcal S)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbb N_{\\operatorname{True}}\\models\n\\forall x\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathcal S}(x)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}(x)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathcal S)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbb N_{\\operatorname{True}}\\models\n\\forall x\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathcal S}(x)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}(x)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两边只是同一外部语义条件的展开：每个由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 证明的算术句在\n标准模型中为真。右侧的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 是扩张结构\n中的新谓词，而不是声称它可在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> 内定义。若用某个原始谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 代替\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>，还必须先证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 在标准模型中充分。</p>\n<p>不能使用\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathcal S}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\">\\(\\mathcal S\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathcal S}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\)</span>；\n这不是一般定理，\n并会与 Löb/不完备性现象冲突。某个更强真理理论能否在内部证明上式的\n编码版本，是独立的证明论问题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-soundness-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"acda8ebf92673c3d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-soundness-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-global-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"16b107dfee99998b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-global-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x),\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathcal S}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}\\coloneqq\n\\{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner:\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0},\n\\ \\mathbb N\\models\\varphi\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N_{\\operatorname{True}}\n\\coloneqq(\\mathbb N,\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathcal S)\\coloneqq\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\n(\\mathcal S\\vdash\\varphi\\Rightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ArSound}(\\mathcal S)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathbb N_{\\operatorname{True}}\\models\n\\forall x\\,\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}(x)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathcal S}(x)\n\\to\n\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}(x)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{True}_{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Pr}_{\\mathcal S}(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)","display":false}],"bytes":2092,"backlinks":[{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-non-creativity.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-stronger-than-provability.md]]\n[[91-thm-typed-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-untyped-nonconservative.md]]"}],"outgoing":["acda8ebf92673c3d","16b107dfee99998b","0838e653809dc677"]}